From: farfetch@ix.netcom.com
Subject: MazeworldCatacombs1.0.5


This is a maintenance release of Mazeworld Catacombs,  an older (much 
older) Farfetch game.  Mazeworld Catacombs is now being released as 
freeware.  You can check out our new game, Mazeworld Abyss, available 
elsewhere or on our web page at <http://members.aol.com/farfetch>.


